if (copy_to_user(u64_to_user_ptr(args->buffer_ptr), ivpu_bo_vaddr(bo), info_size))
    ret = -EFAULT;
Reason:
The firmware returns info_size which is used directly as the copy length in copy_to_user without verifying that it does not exceed the allocated buffer size (bo). If info_size is larger than the buffer, a buffer overflow occurs when copying data from the internal buffer to user space.

The code statements that fix the bug are:
if (info_size > ivpu_bo_size(bo)) {
