                          info_size, ivpu_bo_size(bo));
    ret = -EOVERFLOW;
    goto unlock;
}
Reason:
This added validation ensures that info_size does not exceed the internally allocated buffer size. If the firmware returns an invalid larger size, the operation is rejected with -EOVERFLOW, preventing a potential buffer overflow during the subsequent copy_to_user.

